1
00:00:00,783 --> 00:00:03,346
As Uke comes to take both wrists from behind

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:04,520
lead him towards you

3
00:00:04,521 --> 00:00:06,928
as Uke steps round to grab the other wrist

4
00:00:06,929 --> 00:00:10,936
take a large step forward 
leading both arms up so Uke comes past you

5
00:00:11,237 --> 00:00:13,858
slide back controlling both wrists

6
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:17,459
The bottom arm raises up across 
the top arm and elbow

7
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,779
and extend forward and down into the throw.

